WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.670
<b>Manga</b>

00:01.000 --> 00:03.670
<b>Club</b>

00:02.000 --> 00:03.710
<b>Good work, you two.</b>

00:03.710 --> 00:06.540
<b>I heard good things about your reading sessions.</b>

00:06.540 --> 00:08.670
<b>Sounds like you've got the report ready, too.</b>

00:08.670 --> 00:09.290
<b>No.</b>

00:15.630 --> 00:16.750
<b>Sensei!</b>

00:18.170 --> 00:21.420
<b>We're not submitting this report!</b>

01:58.040 --> 02:03.000
<b>Do You Love Cosplay?</b>

02:03.130 --> 02:06.130
<b>What are you talking about?
You have to submit something!</b>

02:07.290 --> 02:11.750
<b>Senpai and I talked things over,
and we don't want to submit this.</b>

02:14.500 --> 02:17.330
<b>Cool, these pictures came out good.</b>

02:17.330 --> 02:19.130
<b>Not sure if this'll work,</b>

02:19.130 --> 02:22.290
<b>but we'll at least be able to
put together a good report.</b>

02:23.920 --> 02:24.960
<b>Ririsa?</b>

02:26.040 --> 02:29.000
<b>Sorry! That sounds good.</b>

02:32.080 --> 02:36.710
<b>Hey, Senpai?
Something's kind of bothering me.</b>

02:38.250 --> 02:42.830
<b>Yeah... I think I'm feeling the same way.</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:48.920
<b>Like, is this really what
we want to say we're doing?</b>

02:50.250 --> 02:52.330
<b>I dunno.</b>

02:52.960 --> 02:56.580
<b>I mean, we're basically lying to the school, right?</b>

02:57.960 --> 03:03.130
<b>It's not technically wrong,
but it's definitely hiding the truth.</b>

03:04.920 --> 03:07.500
<b>I love cosplay.</b>

03:07.500 --> 03:11.170
<b>Is it really something
I need to hide from everyone?</b>

03:11.880 --> 03:16.130
<b>Personally, I don't think you do, but I dunno...</b>

03:17.580 --> 03:18.880
<b>But, like...</b>

03:18.880 --> 03:25.750
<b>When we visited those kids at school,
being in cosplay felt so normal.</b>

03:27.920 --> 03:29.630
<b>Y-you know,</b>

03:29.630 --> 03:33.250
<b>I just figured we needed to do
something to grab their attention.</b>

03:33.250 --> 03:37.420
<b>I didn't really think you'd take me up on the idea.</b>

03:37.960 --> 03:41.830
<b>I just thought it would be a whole lot more fun for them.</b>

03:43.040 --> 03:47.170
<b>Like, when you see someone in cosplay,
you look at them, right?</b>

03:47.750 --> 03:49.130
<b>And it's not just us...</b>

03:49.130 --> 03:52.040
<b>Cosplay grabs everyone's attention,
in a good way!</b>

03:52.040 --> 03:55.880
<b>So why should we feel like we
need to hide it from people?</b>

03:56.670 --> 04:00.170
<b>Senpai, you told me our passion defines us,</b>

04:01.460 --> 04:04.080
<b>and that gives me the courage to show it.</b>

04:07.170 --> 04:08.250
<b>You're right.</b>

04:12.920 --> 04:14.830
<b>I see where you're coming from.</b>

04:14.830 --> 04:18.130
<b>What about this club room, then?</b>

04:18.130 --> 04:20.960
<b>Without a report, you won't be able to keep it!</b>

04:22.500 --> 04:25.210
<b>You probably haven't heard of it,</b>

04:25.210 --> 04:27.880
<b>but there's a pretty big
cosplay event next week.</b>

04:28.040 --> 04:29.210
<b>There is?</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:33.830
<b>What's at the end of May?
Oh, right, Yokosuka CosStream.</b>

04:34.080 --> 04:35.790
<b>She's definitely heard of it.</b>

04:36.750 --> 04:38.710
<b>Wait, you can't be serious!</b>

04:39.080 --> 04:40.210
<b>We're going!</b>

04:40.210 --> 04:44.670
<b>We're going to participate officially as a club,
and put that in our report!</b>

04:45.290 --> 04:46.630
<b>Are you crazy?!</b>

04:46.630 --> 04:49.210
<b>That's not going to convince
them you're a real club!</b>

04:49.210 --> 04:50.380
<b>Why not?</b>

04:50.580 --> 04:52.080
<b>Are you...</b>

04:52.080 --> 04:56.170
<b>You have no idea how the outside
world judges people who cosplay!</b>

04:56.880 --> 04:59.210
<b>So when are you gonna grow out of that?</b>

04:57.880 --> 05:01.000
<b>How will you explain that to your husband or parents?</b>

04:59.210 --> 04:59.830
<b>Look at that slut.</b>

04:59.830 --> 05:01.830
<b>You just want attention.</b>

05:02.880 --> 05:08.170
<b>Just submit that report and hide the less savory stuff.</b>

05:08.170 --> 05:09.960
<b>Why bother being honest?</b>

05:10.500 --> 05:13.170
<b>That'll save our club room,</b>

05:13.170 --> 05:15.830
<b>but we'd be losing
something else in the process.</b>

05:17.830 --> 05:21.380
<b>What, your pride? Come on...</b>

05:21.380 --> 05:22.540
<b>Can I get your new ROM?</b>

05:23.290 --> 05:24.750
<b>I'll take a full set!</b>

05:25.170 --> 05:28.380
<b>Wow, we're gonna sell out before noon!</b>

05:28.380 --> 05:30.460
<b>We should've made more!</b>

05:30.460 --> 05:33.170
<b>This one was the best one yet.</b>

05:33.170 --> 05:36.380
<b>Any hotter, and we'd have to
slap an "18+" sticker on it!</b>

05:36.500 --> 05:42.540
<b>NEW RELEASE</b>

05:36.500 --> 05:42.540
<b>SOLD OUT!</b>

05:36.500 --> 05:38.790
<b>Hope this doesn't hurt my job hunt...</b>

05:38.790 --> 05:41.670
<b>That's... Something we can worry about later.</b>

05:42.750 --> 05:45.460
<b>Mayura, you going to Winter Comiket?</b>

05:45.460 --> 05:47.250
<b>Of course I'm going!</b>

05:47.250 --> 05:49.750
<b>I've got a cosplay I've spent a whole year making.</b>

05:49.960 --> 05:51.630
<b>It's a masterpiece!</b>

05:51.630 --> 05:53.880
<b>For real?! I can't wait to see it!</b>

05:55.710 --> 05:57.500
<b>I heard you got an offer!</b>

05:55.830 --> 06:01.580
<b>Congratulations!</b>

05:55.830 --> 06:01.580
<b>You've been selected for the pool of incoming teachers.</b>

05:55.830 --> 06:01.580
<b>Placement</b>

05:55.840 --> 06:01.580
<b>HIGH SCHOOL HOME EC</b>

05:57.790 --> 05:58.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:58.790 --> 06:01.380
<b>You're finally gonna be a teacher!</b>

06:02.170 --> 06:05.790
<b>Yeah, so I should probably...</b>

06:05.790 --> 06:09.290
<b>Oh, but you're gonna show off your
masterpiece before then, right?</b>

06:09.290 --> 06:10.130
<b>Huh?</b>

06:10.130 --> 06:12.710
<b>It'll be your last Comiket as a student!</b>

06:13.290 --> 06:18.170
<b>Uh... yeah. You're right.</b>

06:23.710 --> 06:27.750
<b>Don't assume people will take you seriously
just because you're serious about it!</b>

06:27.750 --> 06:30.960
<b>The world is a lot more complicated than that!</b>

06:30.960 --> 06:34.040
<b>Okay, then what do you think about cosplay, Sensei?!</b>

06:34.920 --> 06:39.420
<b>What? W-what do I think?</b>

06:40.460 --> 06:44.710
<b>I always thought it was too
embarrassing to tell anyone about.</b>

06:45.040 --> 06:49.460
<b>Even now, I feel a little embarrassed
to parade around saying it's what I do.</b>

06:49.460 --> 06:54.000
<b>But, if anyone asks me who I am,
I'll tell them this:</b>

06:54.330 --> 06:57.130
<b>I love manga. I love anime.</b>

06:57.580 --> 06:59.040
<b>I love Liliel.</b>

06:59.380 --> 07:01.000
<b>And I love sexy costumes.</b>

07:01.380 --> 07:04.380
<b>I'm a cosplayer!</b>

07:09.080 --> 07:11.250
<b>Whoa, Eri, she's way too young to be here!</b>

07:11.250 --> 07:13.080
<b>Crap, we gotta stop her!</b>

07:13.540 --> 07:15.710
<b>Hey, sweetie, how old are you?</b>

07:18.130 --> 07:22.380
<b>This is a softcore event, so come back
when you're in high school, mmkay?</b>

07:26.460 --> 07:29.380
<b>I wonder if she likes cosplay.</b>

07:29.380 --> 07:31.460
<b>Maybe we'll see her around here someday.</b>

07:31.460 --> 07:32.790
<b>Who knows...</b>

07:33.330 --> 07:37.250
<b>But, it would be fun to see her again.</b>

07:42.830 --> 07:47.580
<b>Sensei, the Manga Club makes, wears,
and takes photos of cosplay.</b>

07:48.080 --> 07:50.330
<b>And we want to be taken seriously for it!</b>

08:00.080 --> 08:02.670
<b>Maybe you're too young and naïve to realize the truth.</b>

08:05.880 --> 08:07.500
<b>Or maybe I'm wrong.</b>

08:08.670 --> 08:14.500
<b>"Why did I spend so much time on something
too embarrassing to talk about in public?"</b>

08:15.040 --> 08:17.750
<b>"But if anyone asks me who I am, I'll tell them this:</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:21.670
<b>"I can't if I want to live my life."</b>

08:22.250 --> 08:25.170
<b>I love manga. I love anime.</b>

08:25.790 --> 08:30.000
<b>"I can't wear it. I'm a teacher now."</b>

08:30.580 --> 08:33.420
<b>I'm a cosplayer!"</b>

08:37.880 --> 08:39.670
<b>You're so determined.</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:41.040
<b>Huh?</b>

08:41.710 --> 08:43.080
<b>"But it would be fun...</b>

08:43.540 --> 08:44.710
<b>How could I...</b>

08:46.380 --> 08:48.500
<b>...to see her again."</b>

08:51.040 --> 08:53.790
<b>How could I not support you all the way?!</b>

08:54.630 --> 08:56.000
<b>Sensei!</b>

08:58.250 --> 09:00.880
<b>But you know what this means, right?</b>

09:01.830 --> 09:08.580
<b>The Manga Club earned its club room
by doing well in big competitions.</b>

09:09.080 --> 09:15.380
<b>A picture of you two having fun at a
cosplay event isn't going to cut it.</b>

09:16.460 --> 09:19.790
<b>I'm the one who has to sign off
on the report for the principal.</b>

09:20.210 --> 09:22.540
<b>You see where I'm going with this?</b>

09:25.710 --> 09:29.290
<b>Fine, I'll spell it out for you.</b>

09:30.250 --> 09:32.040
<b>You've gotta be the best!</b>

09:32.040 --> 09:35.790
<b>You'd better be the most popular
cosplayer there, you got that?!</b>

09:39.630 --> 09:41.670
<b>Y-yes, ma'am!</b>

09:48.920 --> 09:51.040
<b>Can I get this, and this,</b>

09:51.040 --> 09:55.670
<b>and three of each piece of Kai-sama
merch that came out today!</b>

09:56.500 --> 09:58.290
<b>I-I'll get those for you.</b>

09:58.290 --> 10:02.540
<b>Yay! You still had some left! Thank God!</b>

10:02.540 --> 10:06.330
<b>We've got tons left.
The blue one's the least popular.</b>

10:10.630 --> 10:14.290
<b>Oh, Kai-sama,
I'm going to fly up the rankings for you!</b>

10:14.290 --> 10:16.210
<b>I'm going sky-high, my prince!</b>

10:17.420 --> 10:19.170
<b>It's one of those cringe otaku...</b>

10:19.170 --> 10:21.040
<b>How is she not embarrassed?</b>

10:21.040 --> 10:22.750
<b>She's pretty cute, though...</b>

10:23.790 --> 10:27.790
<b>You have a crush on a fictional character?
But you're so pretty.</b>

10:30.630 --> 10:32.000
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

10:33.040 --> 10:36.880
<b>Yup! I don't like 3D boys!</b>

10:41.130 --> 10:43.460
<b>Yokosuka CosStream?</b>

10:43.460 --> 10:46.170
<b>Yes, we'll be there, of course!</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:48.830
<b>That's nice to know.</b>

10:49.380 --> 10:53.210
<b>But it's going to be a fierce battle, my friend.</b>

10:53.210 --> 10:54.000
<b>Huh?</b>

10:54.290 --> 11:00.710
<b>One of the Four Queens of cosplay, Nagomi,
will be working at an official industry booth!</b>

11:01.040 --> 11:02.080
<b>Nagomi?</b>

11:02.080 --> 11:06.130
<b>And she'll be a character
that went viral last week.</b>

11:06.130 --> 11:08.750
<b>Her announcement got 100k retweets!</b>

11:09.250 --> 11:13.250
<b>The fan area may be a ghost town, I'm afraid...</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:15.670
<b>Steel your heart for battle!</b>

11:18.750 --> 11:20.630
<b>Hi, everyone!</b>

11:20.630 --> 11:22.250
<b>Hello!</b>

11:22.250 --> 11:24.210
<b>How's the costume coming along?</b>

11:24.210 --> 11:27.750
<b>You'd better be grabbing the accessories
I asked for last time!</b>

11:28.080 --> 11:30.960
<b>Can we discuss the promo for that new game?</b>

11:30.960 --> 11:33.210
<b>Can you talk while I do your makeup?</b>

11:33.710 --> 11:35.580
<b>That's a lot of stuff.</b>

11:33.920 --> 11:40.420
<b>Prince Charming</b>

11:35.580 --> 11:40.420
<b>The Prince C summer merch dropped today,
so I went to Animate first thing this morning.</b>

11:40.630 --> 11:42.080
<b>That early?</b>

11:42.080 --> 11:45.170
<b>You could've gone next week,
and Kai's merch would still be available.</b>

11:45.170 --> 11:48.750
<b>You wanna die, girlfriend?!
And it's Kai-sama, thank you!</b>

11:54.670 --> 11:56.880
<b>I fell in love with a 2D boy.</b>

11:56.880 --> 12:00.500
<b>Since that fateful day,
I've sworn off 3D men.</b>

12:01.170 --> 12:04.710
<b>And if I want to be his perfect match...</b>

12:08.420 --> 12:11.250
<b>...I'm gonna be the prettiest 2D girl in the world!</b>

12:11.460 --> 12:18.880
<b>Heavenly Queen</b>

12:11.460 --> 12:18.880
<b>Nagomi</b>

12:11.460 --> 12:16.000
<b>Nice, Nagomi-chan! Love that smile!</b>

12:34.170 --> 12:36.630
<b>Looks like this is it.</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:37.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:39.290 --> 12:41.080
<b>This one was pretty far away.</b>

12:42.380 --> 12:45.460
<b>It's also a way bigger venue than the last one.</b>

12:45.460 --> 12:47.750
<b>There's gonna be industry booths here, too!</b>

12:49.790 --> 12:53.460
<b>Y-you kinda look more nervous than me!</b>

12:53.710 --> 13:00.080
<b>Y-yeah, I wanna take really good pictures
we can put in our report!</b>

13:00.790 --> 13:03.710
<b>It's not as fancy as a competition or anything,</b>

13:03.710 --> 13:10.040
<b>but I bet if I can get some exciting pictures,
it'll more than make up for it!</b>

13:11.210 --> 13:15.880
<b>I didn't get any pictures of you surrounded
by that huge crowd,</b>

13:15.880 --> 13:18.250
<b>but if we can get another crowd going...</b>

13:20.670 --> 13:25.830
<b>Y-you want me to do that again,
here, with way more people?</b>

13:28.920 --> 13:30.920
<b>You, uh, okay?</b>

13:31.880 --> 13:36.830
<b>S-senpai, could you say the magic words again?</b>

13:36.830 --> 13:37.670
<b>Huh?</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:42.710
<b>You know, when you said my Liliel was, uh...</b>

13:48.790 --> 13:50.000
<b>You've got this!</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:53.670
<b>Your Liliel is the cutest in the whole world!</b>

13:55.130 --> 13:56.080
<b>Okay!</b>

13:58.290 --> 14:02.380
<b>more embarrassing to</b>

13:58.290 --> 14:02.380
<b>hear than she thought</b>

13:58.290 --> 14:02.380
<b>more embarrassing to</b>

13:58.290 --> 14:02.380
<b>say than he thought</b>

14:03.790 --> 14:05.960
<b>I hope I'm not interrupting!</b>

14:06.330 --> 14:07.330
<b>Magino-san!</b>

14:07.330 --> 14:08.460
<b>Yoohoo!</b>

14:08.460 --> 14:10.250
<b>I'm here, too!</b>

14:12.630 --> 14:15.630
<b>As expected, it's very quiet over here.</b>

14:15.960 --> 14:18.500
<b>We're in the right place, right?</b>

14:18.500 --> 14:25.000
<b>There's already quite the line forming
outside the industry hall!</b>

14:26.040 --> 14:29.500
<b>Everyone is here to see Miss 753, Nagomi!</b>

14:29.630 --> 14:36.790
<b>I'll be Icola at CosStream!</b>

14:29.630 --> 14:36.790
<b>See you there!!</b>

14:30.130 --> 14:31.830
<b>That tracks,</b>

14:31.830 --> 14:38.040
<b>as she's cosplaying character
that was all over social media last week.</b>

14:38.040 --> 14:41.790
<b>She was hired by the company themselves
to wear a professionally-made costume,</b>

14:41.790 --> 14:45.080
<b>a feat made possible only
because she is a professional cosplayer!</b>

14:45.790 --> 14:48.920
<b>Today's battlefield is centered around Miss Nagomi.</b>

14:48.920 --> 14:52.460
<b>Indeed, it already looks fierce.</b>

14:53.210 --> 14:54.830
<b>I hope you came prepared.</b>

14:55.380 --> 14:58.540
<b>'Tis always a tragedy when few
people come to see your costume.</b>

14:58.540 --> 15:01.080
<b>Truly, no sorrow can compare.</b>

15:03.080 --> 15:05.460
<b>Okay, we're gonna go change!</b>

15:05.790 --> 15:07.170
<b>Roger-roger!</b>

15:07.500 --> 15:10.790
<b>Come, friend, let us scope out the field!</b>

15:10.790 --> 15:11.960
<b>O-okay!</b>

15:15.000 --> 15:17.210
<b>Look, there's Nagomi-chan!</b>

15:17.920 --> 15:24.670
<b>Ugh, Kai-sama's UR drop rate is 1.5%?!
Do they just want my whole bank account?!</b>

15:24.670 --> 15:28.080
<b>I got a bunch of extra Kai cards, wanna trade?</b>

15:28.080 --> 15:31.880
<b>Don't treat him like that! And it's Kai-sama!
And thank you!</b>

15:32.750 --> 15:33.920
<b>All of them are Nagomi?!</b>

15:33.920 --> 15:36.420
<b>No, she's the one in the middle!</b>

15:37.000 --> 15:42.630
<b>The rest are from the company.
They're there to support their professional cosplayer.</b>

15:43.170 --> 15:46.290
<b>A professional cosplayer... Wow.</b>

15:52.790 --> 15:54.330
<b>Were you that Liliel?</b>

15:54.330 --> 15:55.130
<b>Huh?!</b>

15:56.170 --> 15:57.290
<b>I thought so.</b>

15:57.290 --> 16:00.830
<b>My photographer showed
me the pic he got of you.</b>

16:01.080 --> 16:07.330
<b>Hi. I didn't post it online, promise!
I barely recognized you here.</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:12.210
<b>You still looked totally 3D, though.
You gotta work on your makeup.</b>

16:12.500 --> 16:15.630
<b>R-really? I better study...</b>

16:16.000 --> 16:17.330
<b>You doing Liliel again today?</b>

16:17.330 --> 16:18.540
<b>Y-yeah!</b>

16:18.540 --> 16:22.330
<b>U-um, what character are you cosplaying as today?</b>

16:24.330 --> 16:25.500
<b>I dunno.</b>

16:25.830 --> 16:26.670
<b>Huh?!</b>

16:26.670 --> 16:28.790
<b>Sorry, who am I again?</b>

16:29.290 --> 16:32.500
<b>Icola, from that new game.</b>

16:32.960 --> 16:35.880
<b>You don't know her,
but you're still cosplaying her?</b>

16:36.830 --> 16:41.710
<b>Yeah. She's not out yet,
so I wouldn't be able to know anything about her.</b>

16:41.710 --> 16:47.630
<b>Pretty much every day I'm cosplaying
a character I don't know much about.</b>

16:47.630 --> 16:49.330
<b>But I do it, 'cause I'm a pro.</b>

16:49.630 --> 16:50.830
<b>Oh...</b>

16:54.130 --> 16:57.000
<b>Look, I know what you're getting at.</b>

16:57.880 --> 17:00.630
<b>It's not really cosplay if I don't love the character.</b>

17:00.630 --> 17:04.330
<b>I'm just doing this to get famous.</b>

17:04.710 --> 17:06.080
<b>I'm a sell-out.</b>

17:06.080 --> 17:09.670
<b>"Pros" are just influencers forced to cosplay.</b>

17:12.380 --> 17:17.580
<b>I've seen all that before in my comments and DMs.
Nothing I'm not already used to.</b>

17:17.580 --> 17:20.960
<b>I-I wasn't thinking that at all, I swear!</b>

17:21.750 --> 17:27.040
<b>There are tons of pros out there who pretend
they love the character so they don't get hate,</b>

17:27.040 --> 17:29.830
<b>but I don't think we should even bother.</b>

17:29.830 --> 17:31.330
<b>Wanna know why?</b>

17:32.000 --> 17:37.000
<b>Because I love cosplay and cosplayers
more than anyone else out there.</b>

17:38.040 --> 17:39.710
<b>When I'm in costume,</b>

17:39.710 --> 17:43.130
<b>that's the only time I can transcend
this third dimension to 2D.</b>

17:46.290 --> 17:51.080
<b>I never want to stop cosplaying.
That's why I do it professionally.</b>

17:51.080 --> 17:53.880
<b>And I'm not just doing it for myself.</b>

17:53.880 --> 17:58.580
<b>I want to wear the most incredible costumes,
and pose for cameras around the world.</b>

17:58.580 --> 18:02.330
<b>I'm going to be the most perfect
2D girl the world has ever seen.</b>

18:03.630 --> 18:06.210
<b>Kai-sama deserves the best, after all.</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:11.040
<b>So that's why you'll cosplay characters
you don't know anything about?</b>

18:11.330 --> 18:15.540
<b>That's right. I mean, think about it.</b>

18:16.000 --> 18:20.500
<b>You love Liliel,
and cosplay is how you show that love.</b>

18:22.290 --> 18:28.210
<b>I love cosplay, live for cosplay,
and show that all through cosplay.</b>

18:28.920 --> 18:29.880
<b>So...</b>

18:30.750 --> 18:33.040
<b>Which one of us loves cosplay more?</b>

18:34.630 --> 18:35.960
<b>Hold on...</b>

18:37.670 --> 18:39.250
<b>Here's some advice:</b>

18:39.250 --> 18:42.960
<b>I'm going to be at the booth at noon,</b>

18:42.960 --> 18:46.830
<b>so beginners like you shouldn't
bother going out there until this afternoon.</b>

18:50.170 --> 18:53.210
<b>I-I'm so sorry.
Please don't take it personally!</b>

18:53.210 --> 18:59.540
<b>She's not trying to be insulting,
she just gets intense about cosplay...</b>

19:02.790 --> 19:04.920
<b>Hi, Liliel-chan!</b>

19:04.920 --> 19:06.830
<b>I didn't think we'd see you till summer!</b>

19:07.330 --> 19:08.420
<b>Yeah...</b>

19:09.170 --> 19:11.580
<b>W-we're not bothering you, are we?</b>

19:11.580 --> 19:13.960
<b>No, it's who we just ran into...</b>

19:14.330 --> 19:15.330
<b>Whoa!</b>

19:15.330 --> 19:18.500
<b>Damn, Nagomi started drama with you?!</b>

19:19.130 --> 19:20.830
<b>I wouldn't call it drama.</b>

19:20.830 --> 19:23.750
<b>I think I said something that made her mad.</b>

19:24.250 --> 19:27.420
<b>Honey, she was absolutely trying to start drama.</b>

19:27.920 --> 19:31.290
<b>But, she really knows her stuff!</b>

19:31.290 --> 19:34.210
<b>I really wish I could've asked her some more questions.</b>

19:34.210 --> 19:36.830
<b>Like, how does she get into character
when she doesn't know them that well?</b>

19:37.290 --> 19:40.670
<b>She's so sweet...
She just needs confidence.</b>

19:41.500 --> 19:44.380
<b>Yeah. I get why that's a downer,
but brighten up!</b>

19:44.380 --> 19:48.460
<b>She's right!
You're gonna need the energy.</b>

19:49.330 --> 19:52.500
<b>If you wanna survive the CosStream
changing room craziness, that is!</b>

19:59.380 --> 20:02.500
<b>C'mon, focus up,
or there'll be no space left for your suitcase!</b>

20:02.500 --> 20:05.540
<b>Yup! Cheer up, we're gonna have fun!</b>

20:06.290 --> 20:07.330
<b>Okay.</b>

20:10.710 --> 20:12.420
<b>I hope she's okay...</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:15.960
<b>Izu-chan, hurry!</b>

20:15.960 --> 20:17.880
<b>Make sure you don't forget anything!</b>

20:17.880 --> 20:19.880
<b>Yeah, I'm going!</b>

20:21.460 --> 20:23.330
<b>We're done here,
so you can spread out if you want!</b>

20:23.330 --> 20:26.500
<b>Oh... Thank you.</b>

20:26.920 --> 20:29.670
<b>We gotta get a spot before the industry hall opens!</b>

20:29.670 --> 20:30.790
<b>Wait up!</b>

20:32.250 --> 20:36.920
<b>Come now, milord Okumura!
I shall explain to you our plan of action.</b>

20:37.170 --> 20:39.460
<b>Y-you already have a plan?</b>

20:39.460 --> 20:41.080
<b>Why, of course!</b>

20:41.080 --> 20:43.750
<b>Direct your attention to the map here.</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:56.790
<b>Parking Lot Area</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:56.790
<b>General Traffic Flow</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:56.790
<b>Underground Walkway</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:56.790
<b>Outdoor Photo Area</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:56.790
<b>Hall A</b>

20:43.920 --> 20:56.790
<b>Hall B</b>

20:44.750 --> 20:50.080
<b>Regular attendees like ourselves are limited
to Hall A and the outdoor photo areas.</b>

20:50.080 --> 20:56.210
<b>However, most attendees with tickets are
heading to Hall B for the industry booths.</b>

20:57.380 --> 20:58.710
<b>So that means...</b>

20:58.710 --> 21:05.420
<b>Yes, what we're fearing is that most attendees
will leave right after seeing Miss Nagomi.</b>

21:06.080 --> 21:10.920
<b>If so, then they will head for the
exit nearest to the industry hall,</b>

21:10.920 --> 21:12.210
<b>through this passageway.</b>

21:12.210 --> 21:14.670
<b>That is where we will stake our claim!</b>

21:15.540 --> 21:21.580
<b>Few cosplayers will station themselves there,
and everyone will need to pass by us!</b>

21:21.580 --> 21:26.420
<b>If enough stop for pictures,
we will most certainly create a buzzing crowd!</b>

21:26.420 --> 21:28.380
<b>T-that makes sense!</b>

21:28.750 --> 21:34.920
<b>At worst, we can aim for the time period when
Miss Nagomi returns to her booth,</b>

21:34.920 --> 21:42.040
<b>but we may need to prepare for
most attendees to leave when she does.</b>

21:43.250 --> 21:44.330
<b>No matter!</b>

21:44.330 --> 21:51.380
<b>Clash with the Heavenly Queens is inevitable
when aiming for the highest heights!</b>

21:53.290 --> 21:56.000
<b>Let us go forth, milord Okumura!</b>

21:56.000 --> 21:57.330
<b>O-okay!</b>

21:58.250 --> 22:00.790
<b>We can do this, Ririsa!</b>

22:06.420 --> 22:07.290
<b>"So...</b>

22:08.080 --> 22:10.500
<b>Which one of us loves cosplay more?"</b>

22:19.290 --> 22:24.420
<b>Cosplay Stream 55 will begin shortly!</b>

23:56.080 --> 24:00.210
<b>You're Not Liliel!</b>
